<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mirror (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859257"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:43.777"><div begin="36.657" end="5:43.777"><p begin="36.657" end="42.374" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="36.657" end="36.922">Some</span><span begin="36.922" end="37.520">times</span> <span begin="40.689" end="40.933">the</span> <span begin="40.933" end="41.011">in</span><span begin="41.011" end="41.121">ner</span> <span begin="41.121" end="41.547">voice</span> <span begin="41.547" end="41.612">is</span> <span begin="41.612" end="41.700">en</span><span begin="41.700" end="41.876">cou</span><span begin="41.876" end="42.045">ra</span><span begin="42.045" end="42.374">ging</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些时候 内心的声音是那样鼓舞人心</span></p><p begin="44.497" end="47.395" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="44.497" end="44.597">Cal</span><span begin="44.597" end="44.804">ling</span> <span begin="44.804" end="44.919">for</span> <span begin="44.919" end="45.150">you</span> <span begin="45.150" end="45.252">to</span> <span begin="45.252" end="45.485">run</span> <span begin="45.485" end="45.839">those</span> <span begin="45.839" end="46.105">fi</span><span begin="46.105" end="46.315">nal</span> <span begin="46.315" end="46.567">few</span> <span begin="46.567" end="47.395">yards</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">呼唤着你坚持跑过最后的那几码路程</span></p><p begin="47.395" end="48.846" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="47.395" end="47.613">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="47.613" end="47.686">near</span><span begin="47.686" end="47.784">ly</span> <span begin="47.784" end="48.205">there</span> <span begin="48.205" end="48.433">keep</span> <span begin="48.433" end="48.660">go</span><span begin="48.660" end="48.846">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就快胜利了 继续下去 坚持到底</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="48.846" end="50.896"><span begin="48.846" end="49.160">(Keep</span> <span begin="49.160" end="49.351">go</span><span begin="49.351" end="49.534">ing</span> <span begin="49.534" end="49.821">Keep</span> <span begin="49.821" end="50.014">Go</span><span begin="50.014" end="50.197">ing</span> <span begin="50.197" end="50.574">Keep</span> <span begin="50.574" end="50.713">Go</span><span begin="50.713" end="50.896">ing)</span></span></p><p begin="50.896" end="53.229" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="50.896" end="51.013">It</span> <span begin="51.013" end="51.226">will</span> <span begin="51.226" end="51.748">all</span> <span begin="51.748" end="51.914">be</span> <span begin="51.914" end="52.138">o</span><span begin="52.138" end="52.500">kay</span> <span begin="52.500" end="52.593">in</span> <span begin="52.593" end="52.705">the</span> <span begin="52.705" end="53.229">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最终 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="1:11.511" end="1:14.936" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.511" end="1:11.766">Well</span> <span begin="1:11.766" end="1:12.132">you</span> <span begin="1:12.132" end="1:12.624">were</span> <span begin="1:12.624" end="1:12.859">the</span> <span begin="1:12.859" end="1:13.646">af</span><span begin="1:13.646" end="1:13.890">ter</span><span begin="1:13.890" end="1:14.936">math</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是那场浩劫的余波</span></p><p begin="1:15.784" end="1:19.009" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.784" end="1:16.019">Of</span> <span begin="1:16.019" end="1:16.589">e</span><span begin="1:16.589" end="1:17.122">very</span> <span begin="1:17.122" end="1:17.952">judg</span><span begin="1:17.952" end="1:19.009">ment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被人非议的创伤难以抚平</span></p><p begin="1:20.047" end="1:23.326" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.047" end="1:20.334">So</span> <span begin="1:20.334" end="1:20.759">cold</span> <span begin="1:20.759" end="1:21.138">by</span> <span begin="1:21.138" end="1:21.389">the</span> <span begin="1:21.389" end="1:22.189">sweat</span> <span begin="1:22.189" end="1:23.326">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">冷汗浸透你的衣衫</span></p><p begin="1:24.333" end="1:26.141" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.333" end="1:24.568">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:24.568" end="1:24.990">waste</span> <span begin="1:24.990" end="1:25.399">a</span><span begin="1:25.399" end="1:26.141">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就此颓废堕落</span></p><p begin="1:28.535" end="1:31.952" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.535" end="1:28.643">And</span> <span begin="1:28.643" end="1:28.905">you</span> <span begin="1:28.905" end="1:29.322">car</span><span begin="1:29.322" end="1:29.722">ry</span> <span begin="1:29.722" end="1:29.996">your</span> <span begin="1:29.996" end="1:30.781">e</span><span begin="1:30.781" end="1:31.045">ne</span><span begin="1:31.045" end="1:31.952">mies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而你背负着你所有的敌人</span></p><p begin="1:32.805" end="1:35.915" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.805" end="1:32.928">But</span> <span begin="1:32.928" end="1:33.212">they&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:33.212" end="1:33.741">so</span> <span begin="1:33.741" end="1:34.308">fa</span><span begin="1:34.308" end="1:34.842">mi</span><span begin="1:34.842" end="1:35.915">liar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但他们是那样似曾相识</span></p><p begin="1:37.211" end="1:40.207" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.211" end="1:37.455">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:37.455" end="1:37.903">sick</span> <span begin="1:37.903" end="1:38.310">of</span> <span begin="1:38.310" end="1:38.555">the</span> <span begin="1:38.555" end="1:39.360">com</span><span begin="1:39.360" end="1:39.615">pa</span><span begin="1:39.615" end="1:40.207">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已经厌倦了陪伴</span></p><p begin="1:41.395" end="1:43.138" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.395" end="1:41.527">So</span> <span begin="1:41.527" end="1:41.775">I</span> <span begin="1:41.775" end="1:42.196">cull</span> <span begin="1:42.196" end="1:42.565">the</span> <span begin="1:42.565" end="1:43.138">shame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以也无所谓那些耻辱</span></p><p begin="1:44.056" end="1:47.958" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:44.056" end="1:44.158">And</span> <span begin="1:44.158" end="1:44.409">I</span> <span begin="1:44.409" end="1:44.677">know</span> <span begin="1:44.677" end="1:44.962">you&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:44.962" end="1:45.558">say</span> <span begin="1:45.558" end="1:46.094">how</span> <span begin="1:46.094" end="1:46.602">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:46.602" end="1:46.856">a</span> <span begin="1:46.856" end="1:47.443">bur</span><span begin="1:47.443" end="1:47.958">den</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我知道 你觉得我是个沉重的累赘</span></p><p begin="1:48.458" end="1:52.136" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:48.458" end="1:48.727">Yeah</span> <span begin="1:48.727" end="1:49.017">do</span> <span begin="1:49.017" end="1:49.274">your</span> <span begin="1:49.274" end="1:49.803">worst</span> <span begin="1:49.803" end="1:50.892">all</span> <span begin="1:50.892" end="1:51.131">at</span> <span begin="1:51.131" end="1:52.136">once</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊 全部都一次性发泄出来吧</span></p><p begin="1:52.637" end="1:54.950" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.637" end="1:52.748">I</span> <span begin="1:52.748" end="1:53.010">know</span> <span begin="1:53.010" end="1:53.292">what</span> <span begin="1:53.292" end="1:53.580">you</span> <span begin="1:53.580" end="1:53.973">want</span> <span begin="1:53.973" end="1:54.371">from</span> <span begin="1:54.371" end="1:54.950">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你想从我这里得到什么</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:55.175" end="1:56.304"><span begin="1:55.175" end="1:55.580">(From</span> <span begin="1:55.580" end="1:56.304">me)</span></span></p><p begin="1:56.949" end="1:58.740" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.949" end="1:57.053">I</span> <span begin="1:57.053" end="1:57.281">know</span> <span begin="1:57.281" end="1:57.587">what</span> <span begin="1:57.587" end="1:57.855">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:57.855" end="1:58.237">thin</span><span begin="1:58.237" end="1:58.740">king</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你怀揣着怎样的念想</span></p><p begin="2:01.302" end="2:05.367" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.302" end="2:01.362">And</span> <span begin="2:01.362" end="2:01.598">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:01.598" end="2:01.876">not</span> <span begin="2:01.876" end="2:02.145">the</span> <span begin="2:02.145" end="2:02.653">voice</span> <span begin="2:02.653" end="2:03.227">of</span> <span begin="2:03.227" end="2:03.758">all</span> <span begin="2:03.758" end="2:04.013">the</span> <span begin="2:04.013" end="2:04.547">o</span><span begin="2:04.547" end="2:05.367">thers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而这些话语并非来自那尘世的喧嚣</span></p><p begin="2:05.602" end="2:09.228" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.602" end="2:05.880">You&apos;ve</span> <span begin="2:05.880" end="2:06.161">on</span><span begin="2:06.161" end="2:06.445">ly</span> <span begin="2:06.445" end="2:06.972">said</span> <span begin="2:06.972" end="2:07.488">it</span> <span begin="2:07.488" end="2:07.902">to</span> <span begin="2:07.902" end="2:08.307">your</span><span begin="2:08.307" end="2:09.228">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你只对自己悄声呢喃过这些话</span></p><p begin="2:09.765" end="2:11.977" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.765" end="2:09.835">I</span> <span begin="2:09.835" end="2:10.095">know</span> <span begin="2:10.095" end="2:10.418">what</span> <span begin="2:10.418" end="2:10.720">you</span> <span begin="2:10.720" end="2:11.093">want</span> <span begin="2:11.093" end="2:11.510">from</span> <span begin="2:11.510" end="2:11.977">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你想从我这里得到什么</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:12.271" end="2:13.378"><span begin="2:12.271" end="2:12.690">(From</span> <span begin="2:12.690" end="2:13.378">me)</span></span></p><p begin="2:14.060" end="2:15.950" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.060" end="2:14.160">I</span> <span begin="2:14.160" end="2:14.405">know</span> <span begin="2:14.405" end="2:14.700">what</span> <span begin="2:14.700" end="2:14.988">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:14.988" end="2:15.402">thin</span><span begin="2:15.402" end="2:15.950">king</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你怀揣着怎样的念想</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:15.950" end="2:18.900"><span begin="2:15.950" end="2:16.050">(They</span> <span begin="2:16.050" end="2:16.200">come</span> <span begin="2:16.200" end="2:16.405">to</span> <span begin="2:16.405" end="2:16.625">feel</span> <span begin="2:16.625" end="2:16.882">like</span> <span begin="2:16.882" end="2:17.290">things</span> <span begin="2:17.290" end="2:17.495">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:17.495" end="2:17.739">say</span><span begin="2:17.739" end="2:17.990">ing</span> <span begin="2:17.990" end="2:18.200">to</span> <span begin="2:18.200" end="2:18.278">our</span><span begin="2:18.278" end="2:18.900">selves)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些话语 慢慢地变得像是我们的自说自话</span></span></p><p begin="2:20.056" end="2:23.626" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="